        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Billie Joe Armstrong, Jason White\n- Bands: Pinhead Gunpowder, Green Day, California\n- Places: East Bay, California\n- Music releases: Fahizah\n- Companies: Adeline Records\n\nFacts:\n- Pinhead Gunpowder is an American punk rock band that formed in East Bay, California, in 1990.\n- Billie Joe Armstrong was born on February 17, 1972, and he is an American musician, singer, songwriter, and actor.\n- Billie Joe Armstrong is best known as the lead vocalist, primary songwriter, and guitarist of Green Day, which he co-founded with Mike Dirnt.\n- Fahizah is the second EP by the American punk rock band Pinhead Gunpowder.\n- Jason White is the guitarist and vocalist for the Californian punk band Pinhead Gunpowder.\n- Jason White is the lead guitarist and lead vocalist for the band California.\n- Jason White co-founded Adeline Records with Billie Joe Armstrong.",
